{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":494677,"name":"charles ","username":"Innovaite","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/i/3d9bf3/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T07:21:34.880Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494677-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494677-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBugbot / Security Review Agent\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494677-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494677-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll Grok Bots on my account have stopped responding completely.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMessages appear to send normally, but there is no response from the bot — even when sending something as simple as “Hi”.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis affects every bot on my account, not just one conversation or one bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen any Grok Bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a message such as “Hi”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMessage appears in the conversation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo bot response is generated.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe same behaviour occurs across all of my bots.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTroubleshooting Already Completed\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConfirmed I have 100% usage available\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestarted Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdated to the latest available Grok Bot version\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTested multiple existing bots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTested duplicated bots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePerformed Agent Computer recovery\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAgent Computer was successfully recreated/reconnected\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePerformed a full Agent Computer reset\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTested again after reset\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstalled the latest software update released today\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNone of these steps changed the behaviour.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExpected Behaviour\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBots should process the message and respond normally.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActual Behaviour\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMessages send but all bots remain completely silent.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImpact\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a complete loss of Grok Bot functionality for my account. I was testing Grok Bot for business workflows and currently cannot use any of the bots at all.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am also on a free trial, so this issue is consuming the period in which I am supposed to be evaluating the product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSince resetting/recreating the Agent Computer did not fix the problem, could the team please investigate whether my account, bot-processing backend, session runner or provisioning state is stuck?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease preserve my existing bots, conversations, routines and configuration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnvironment\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApproximate issue start: 16 September 2026, around 21:20 BST\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eError message: None — messages simply receive no response\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExample affected bot: Victor Innovaite COF\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI can provide screenshots or additional diagnostics if required.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494677-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494677-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bug is still on going til date\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494677-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494677-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eZero response what’s so ever I’m loosing all my trials not a single bot ad responded to me I. Two days\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494677-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494677-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/e/2ea2693bd00abbaa33b621425c18dbd1e3e05470.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/6ExVwh2OWAYhEHjEI7bMY9YKybe.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"IMG_0166.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/e/2ea2693bd00abbaa33b621425c18dbd1e3e05470_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_0166.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"6ExVwh2OWAYhEHjEI7bMY9YKybe\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/e/2ea2693bd00abbaa33b621425c18dbd1e3e05470_2_230x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/e/2ea2693bd00abbaa33b621425c18dbd1e3e05470_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/e/2ea2693bd00abbaa33b621425c18dbd1e3e05470_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F0F0F1\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_0166.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1179×2556 238 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/7/d/7dfb2a41d218f0183712d3a6ecc4602cabbc87f7.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/hYtNKJt7D6Hmno7Agl46DlbE8WX.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"IMG_0167.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/7/d/7dfb2a41d218f0183712d3a6ecc4602cabbc87f7_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_0167.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"hYtNKJt7D6Hmno7Agl46DlbE8WX\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/7/d/7dfb2a41d218f0183712d3a6ecc4602cabbc87f7_2_230x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/7/d/7dfb2a41d218f0183712d3a6ecc4602cabbc87f7_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/7/d/7dfb2a41d218f0183712d3a6ecc4602cabbc87f7_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"D3D3D2\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_0167.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1179×2556 195 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494677-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494677-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494677-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494677-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom bot version 0.56.1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494677-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494677-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T07:45:47.514Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":64,"reads":17,"readers_count":16,"score":323.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172118,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-all-bots-completely-unresponsive-after-update-agent-computer-recovery-and-reset","display_username":"charles ","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138582,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-all-bots-completely-unresponsive-after-update-agent-computer-recovery-and-reset/172118/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":494686,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T07:45:25.107Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. I looked into what’s happening, and the good news is your bots and Agent Computer are fine. Nothing is stuck.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is about the usage credit that comes with the Grok Bot free trial. It was fully used up on 16 September at around 20:45 UK time. From that point on, every message gets rejected before the bot can respond, which matches exactly when things went quiet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe app should’ve shown a clear “usage limit reached” notice instead of staying silent. It didn’t, and that’s a known issue we’re tracking. I’ve shared the details with the team.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne more thing. In Settings \u0026gt; Usage, the percentage shows how much of the trial usage you’ve already used. So 100% means it’s all used up, not that it’s all available.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo keep using the bots, you’ll need to upgrade to a Cursor plan that includes Grok Bot (upgrade options are shown in the Grok Bot app under Settings \u0026gt; Usage), or link a SuperGrok subscription. All your bots, chats, routines, and settings are saved and will continue from where you left off. You don’t need to reset or recover Agent Computer again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if anything behaves oddly after you upgrade.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T07:45:25.107Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":4,"reads":15,"readers_count":14,"score":23.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172118,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-all-bots-completely-unresponsive-after-update-agent-computer-recovery-and-reset","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-all-bots-completely-unresponsive-after-update-agent-computer-recovery-and-reset/172118/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":494899,"name":"Mirko Rapicano","username":"Mirko_Rapicano","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/d26b3c/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T10:37:19.818Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThis post was flagged by the community and is temporarily hidden.\u003c/p\u003e","cooked_hidden":true,"post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T19:27:44.432Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":10,"readers_count":9,"score":7.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172118,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-all-bots-completely-unresponsive-after-update-agent-computer-recovery-and-reset","display_username":"Mirko Rapicano","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138614,"hidden":true,"hidden_reason_id":1,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-all-bots-completely-unresponsive-after-update-agent-computer-recovery-and-reset/172118/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":495056,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T13:11:48.036Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, I get it. When a bot silently stops replying and gives you no signal at all, it’s really confusing and gets in the way.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn most cases, this kind of “silent” stop means you’ve hit the usage limit. Your messages are sent, but they get rejected on the server before the bot can reply. The problem is that right now you don’t see a clear “usage limit reached” notification. It should show up, but it doesn’t. This is a known issue we’re tracking. You can check your limit in Settings \u0026gt; Usage the percentage shows how much you’ve used, not how much you have left.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut in your case it might not be the limit. To look into your specific situation, can you share a couple of details:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ethe name of the bot that went silent, and roughly when it last happened including your timezone\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ethe Request ID if you can grab it in the bot chat: menu in the top-right corner \u0026gt; Copy Request ID\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eyour Grok Bot version and OS version\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith that, I can check what’s happening on your side.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":9,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T13:11:48.036Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":7,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":6.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172118,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-all-bots-completely-unresponsive-after-update-agent-computer-recovery-and-reset","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":138614,"username":"Mirko_Rapicano","name":"Mirko Rapicano","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/d26b3c/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-all-bots-completely-unresponsive-after-update-agent-computer-recovery-and-reset/172118/9","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":495419,"name":"charles ","username":"Innovaite","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/i/3d9bf3/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T20:15:29.779Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi, thanks for getting back to me.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI followed the advice and purchased a SuperGrok account, but I’m still having trouble getting it connected properly to the Grok Bot account I was already using.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy original Grok Bot setup, including my existing bots, is on my Cursor account. I have now bought SuperGrok, but the SuperGrok account does not appear to be properly linked to that existing Cursor/Grok Bot account, and my bots are still not working.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve been trying to sort this out for most of the day and I’m honestly getting very frustrated.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCould you please help me get the SuperGrok subscription linked to the correct existing Cursor account so I can continue using my original bots and conversations?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI can provide both account emails, screenshots, or any other information you need.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks,\u003cbr\u003e\nCharles\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":10,"p